{
  "title": "Salawat upon the Holy Prophet",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ كَمَا حَمَلَ وَحْيَكَ وَ بَلَّغَ رِسَالَاتِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN KAMAA HAMALA WAHYAKA WA BALLAGHA RISAALAATIK\nO Allah, bless Muhammad, as he bore Your revelation and conveyed Your messages,\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ كَمَا اَحَلَّ حَلَالَكَ وَ حَرَّمَ حَرَامَكَ وَ عَلَّمَ كِتَابَكَ\nWA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN KAMAA AHALLA HALAALAKA WA HARRAMA HARAAMAKA WA A'LLAMA KITAABAK\nand bless Muhammad, as he permitted what You made lawful, forbade what You made unlawful, and taught Your Book,\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ كَمَاۤ اَقَامَ الصَّلَاةَ وَ اٰتَى الزَّكَاةَ وَ دَعَاۤ اِلٰى دِيْنِكَ\nWA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN KAMAA AQAAMAS SALAATA WA AATAZ ZAKAATA WA DA-A'AA ILAA DEENIK\nand bless Muhammad, as he established prayer, gave the zakat, and called to Your religion,\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ كَمَا صَدَّقَ بِوَعْدِكَ وَ اَشْفَقَ مِنْ وَعِيْدِكَ\nWA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN KAMAA SADDAQA BI-WA'DIKA WA ASHFAQA MIN WA-E'EDIK\nand bless Muhammad, as he believed in Your promise and feared Your threat,\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ كَمَا غَفَرْتَ بِهِ الذُّنُوْبَ وَ سَتَرْتَ بِهِ الْعُيُوْبَ وَ فَرَّجْتَ بِهِ الْكُرُوْبَ\nWA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN KAMAA GHAFARTA BIHIZ ZUNOOBA WA SATARTA BIHIL U'YOOBA WA FARRAJTA BIHIL KUROOB\nand bless Muhammad, as through him You forgave sins, concealed faults, and relieved distresses,\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ كَمَا دَفَعْتَ بِهِ الشَّقَاۤءَ وَ كَشَفْتَ بِهِ الْغَمَّاۤءَ وَ اَجَبْتَ بِهِ الدُّعَاۤءَ وَ نَجَّيْتَ بِهِ مِنَ الْبَلَاۤءِ\nWA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN KAMAA DAFA-A'TA BIHISH SHAQAAA-A WA KASHAFTA BIHIL GHAMMAAA-A WA AJABTA BIHID DUA-A'AA-A WA NAJJAYTA BIHI MINAL BALAAA-I\nand bless Muhammad, as through him You warded off misery, dispelled anguish, answered supplication, and delivered from affliction,\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ كَمَا رَحِمْتَ بِهِ الْعِبَادَ وَ اَحْيَيْتَ بِهِ الْبِلَادَ وَ قَصَمْتَ بِهِ الْجَبَابِرَةَ وَ اَهْلَكْتَ بِهِ الْفَرَاعِنَةَ\nWA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN KAMAA RAHIMTA BIHIL I'BAADA WA AHYAYTA BIHIL BILAADA WA QASAMTA BIHIL JABAABIRATA WA AHLAKTA BIHIL FARAA-I'NAH\nand bless Muhammad, as through him You had mercy on Your servants, revived the lands, crushed the tyrants, and destroyed the pharaohs,\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ كَمَاۤ اَضْعَفْتَ بِهِ الْاَمْوَالَ وَ اَحْرَزْتَ بِهِ مِنَ الْاَهْوَالِ وَ كَسَرْتَ بِهِ الْاَصْنَامَ وَ رَحِمْتَ بِهِ الْاَنَامَ\nWA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN KAMAA ADA'FTA BIHIL AMWAALA WA AHRAZTA BIHI MINAL AHWAALI WA KASARTA BIHIL ASNAAMA WA RAHIMTA BIHIL ANAAM\nand bless Muhammad, as through him You multiplied wealth, guarded against terrors, broke the idols, and had mercy on mankind,\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ كَمَا بَعَثْتَهُ بِخَيْرِ الْاَدْيَانِ وَ اَعْزَزْتَ بِهِ الْاِيْمَانَ وَ تَبَّرْتَ بِهِ الْاَوْثَانَ وَ عَظَّمْتَ بِهِ الْبَيْتَ الْحَرَامَ\nWA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN KAMAA BA-A'THTAHU BI-KHAYRIL ADYAANI WA A-A'ZAZTA BIHIL EEMAANA WA TABBARTA BIHIL AWTHAANA WA A'ZZAMTA BIHIL BAYTAL HARAAM\nand bless Muhammad, as You sent him with the best of religions, strengthened faith through him, shattered idols through him, and glorified the Sacred House through him,\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَ اَهْلِ بَيْتِهِ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ الْاَخْيَارِ وَ سَلَّمَ تَسْلِيْمًا\nWA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIW WA AHLI BAYTIHIT TAAHIREENAL AKHYAAR WA SALLIM TASLEEMAA\nand bless Muhammad and his pure, virtuous Household, and grant them peace, abundantly."
}
